wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/58142-the-lgbt-thread?p=810471#post810471\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Bear Power, man! Bisexual Bear's are best! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://fbcdn-sphotos-c-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-xap1/v/t1.0-9/298472_1815958133604_881355201_n.jpg?oh=482d7d52b5fc1163246794e8afc248f3&amp;oe=5746F194&amp;__gda__=1459518265_d595bf59f905533d02eec0f92b78963f\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-10T09:28:28-08:00","id":827568,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/827223-other-uplifted-animals?p=827565#post827565\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh, you have BEARs all around you on the forums. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Sure, but wouldn't it be great to play a bear in Pugmire? <br /> <br /> ...or maybe it would be better to keep bears non-uplifted, so someone can do a Pugmire version of <a href=\"http://imgur.com/tAV3wHl\" target=\"_blank\">Sir Bearington</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5695-aceofalmonds","name":"AceOfAlmonds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5695_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"323"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-10T14:49:56-08:00","id":827806,"title":"","content":"I kind of want Seals to be uplifted now... Would also include Walruses Dugongs and Sea Lions","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 02-10-2016, 05:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-11T02:20:11-08:00","id":828091,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/827223-other-uplifted-animals?p=827333#post827333\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">According to the Early Access PDF:<br /> Rats, who are apparently in <b><i>constant conflict</i></b> with the cats. (Also including mice, if the Cult of the White Mice is anything to go by.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Probably not all the cats, though. There's certainly a very shady cat by the name of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Amazing_Maurice_and_his_Educated_Rodents\" target=\"_blank\">Maurice</a> who's either conning or goading a group of uplifted rats for his own gain for sure.<br /> And if you go by Felidae by Akif Pirin\u00e7ci as an inspiration/source, then the cats might have an individual influenced by the Cult of the White Mice or something similar. This cat tries to hide it's true intentions, as it knows the Monarchy will come down on it hard if any other cat finds out about his/her plans.<br /> <br /> And for the group no one has mentioned yet: Dolphins. Just to invoke, &quot;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Day_of_the_Dolphin\" target=\"_blank\">The Day of the Dolphin</a>&quot;.<br /> <br /> I would also love to see Hyenas at some point or in a mythical context, simply because of all the recent studies on their intelligence (Being similar or higher than Apes, Dolphins, etc.).<br /> At least they could provide for some great myths for Pugmire: A race that should have not been, as they combined both the features of cats and dogs. And as an object lesson or bogeyman to Pugmire dogs when you view yourself in the same light as a human (God/s). Or as a &quot;Fall from Grace&quot; type of story.<br /> No one knows if they still exist or not at all, if the humans wiped them out when they proved to be too smart for their own good, or if they are trying to take man's place in his absence. Maybe it's just stories, who knows.<br /> <br /> I know Eddy wants to avoid Apes because that might be too similar and on the nose to Planet of the Apes, but Hyenas could easily be the replacement for Apes in the setting.<br /> With a Pugmire dog telling fantastical fantasy stories about a dog who is raised by them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1137,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","user":"Laughing Hyena","date":". 02-11-2016, 05:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}